{"id":"n37198-3-7","stage":3,"title":"쫓다 · 驱赶","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37198-3-7-1","ko":"너무 졸려서 공부를 못 하겠네.","zh":"我太困了，根本没法学习。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"졸려서","meaning":"困","explanation":"졸리다：困；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"졸리다","audio":"/audio/2666ddee9bee00d2539f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24623","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하겠네.","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"2666ddee9bee00d2","term":"졸리다","zh":"困","audio":"/audio/2666ddee9bee00d2539f.mp3","entryId":"24623","definition":"有想睡觉的感觉。","pronunciation":["졸ː리다"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示想法或推测。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示想法或推测。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c8f42f95a2b0ea5557a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37198-3-7-2","ko":"잠깐 바람이라도 쐬면서 잠을 쫓고 와.","zh":"去外面透透气，把困意赶走再回来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람이라도","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쐬면서","meaning":"晒，吹","explanation":"쐬다：晒，吹；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"쐬다","audio":"/audio/50ec34bea34fbd636d35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66397","senseId":"1","lemma":"쐬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쫓고","meaning":"驱赶","explanation":"쫓다：驱赶；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쫓다","audio":"/audio/e035a6f89994bd9e0b96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37198","senseId":"3","lemma":"쫓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57312","definition":"非常短的时间。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"50ec34bea34fbd63","term":"쐬다","zh":"晒，吹","audio":"/audio/50ec34bea34fbd636d35.mp3","entryId":"66397","definition":"脸或身体直接感受到风或阳光等。","pronunciation":["쐬ː다","쒜ː다"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"e035a6f89994bd9e","term":"쫓다","zh":"驱赶","audio":"/audio/e035a6f89994bd9e0b96.mp3","entryId":"37198","definition":"赶走困意或杂念等。","pronunciation":["쫃따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f1ddd58d68c323c00a7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.942,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37198","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":101,"sequenceScore":2.6673,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["去外面透透气，把困意赶走再回来吧。","我太困了，根本没法学习。","走这条巷子的话能更快到达哦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我太困了，根本没法学习。","走这条巷子的话能更快到达哦。","去外面透透气，把困意赶走再回来吧。"],"answer":2}]}
